' Style dùng chung cho mọi sơ đồ: đen trắng, một màu nhấn emerald, chữ Times New Roman.
skinparam defaultFontName Times New Roman
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundCorner 6
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam ArrowColor #1F2937
skinparam BorderColor #1F2937
skinparam classBackgroundColor white
skinparam classHeaderBackgroundColor #E7F8EF
skinparam componentBackgroundColor white
skinparam nodeBackgroundColor white
skinparam databaseBackgroundColor #E7F8EF
skinparam actorBorderColor #1F2937
skinparam usecaseBackgroundColor white
skinparam participantBackgroundColor white
skinparam sequenceLifeLineBorderColor #9CA3AF
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #F5F5F7
skinparam noteBorderColor #9CA3AF
hide circle
